   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 672 of the laws of 1993, amending the public\nauthorities law relating to the construction and financing of facilities for\ncertain public libraries, in relation to including the North Greenbush Public\nLibrary",
    "basePrintNo": "S4389",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4389-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §5, Chap 672 of 1993",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S4389\n\nSPONSOR: ASHBY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 672 of the laws of 1993, amending the public\nauthorities law relating to the construction and financing of facilities\nfor certain public libraries, in relation to including the North Green-\nbush Public Library\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo allow for the financing of construction projects for the North Green-\nbush Public Library by the New York State Dormitory Authority\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 - Authorizes the North Greenbush Public Library to participate\nin financing offered by the Dormitory Authority of the State of New York\n\nSection 2 - Sets forth the effective date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe North Greenbush Public Library requested this legislation to assist\nthem as they move forward with major renovations and new construction.\nIf successful, their participation in DASNY financing will provide\nstability to the project and save taxpayers money on interest when\ncompared with a private sector loan.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nS.9534 of 2022: referred to Rules.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
